>2) The Hand of Elbereth:
>In addition, if you are chaotic, Stormbringer will appear at your feet.

If you're currently wielding a (non-artifact) long-sword, and you are 
non-chaotic, that long-sword will become Excalibur.  If you are chaotic
and Stormbringer does not yet exist in your game, you will be given
Stormbringer.  If Stormbringer does exist, you will be given a blessed
broadsword with a nice bonus (assuming you're chaotic, of course).

>3) The Moon:
>The spoilers say that full moon/new moon
>affect some monsters (presumably weremonsters) but I wasn't able to
>determine how.

The Spoilers do?  Please tell me where, because I'm pretty sure that if
that's in the Spoilers, it's an error...  The only thing that I know of
that the phase of the moon affects is your luck - on full moons, you 
start with extra luck, and on new moons you start with negative luck.

